(1565598, 'Dan Bandung', 'Drama', 120, 'NR', 'Basil, a working-studying Fine Arts student, falls in love with Elma after meeting her at a Persib soccer match. He creates a t-shirt featuring her image that goes viral, leading to their acquaintance and eventual dating. However, their relationship faces opposition from Elma''s father, forcing Basil to fight for his love amidst various obstacles.', '#7c2d12', '#1c1917', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/fSK0eQ6toOrjTpRtqB1WoqN50cc.jpg', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w1280/3W9ipa59TAws4nAbaP0SdksktJG.jpg', 6.2, 'l5GGKpxcCYc', '2026-08-20', 4.653, 3, 'tt43602769', 7.5, 14, null, null),
(1450470, 'Perumahan Laddaland', 'Drama', 99, 'NR', 'Demi memberikan kehidupan yang lebih layak bagi istri dan anak-anaknya, Tomy (Andri Mashadi) memberanikan diri mengambil KPR untuk membeli rumah impian. Kebahagiaan itu tak berlangsung lama. Sejak menempati perumahan baru, keluarganya diteror berbagai kejadian tak wajar. Bisikan misterius, penampakan mengerikan, dan rahasia kelam di balik perumahan tersebut mengancam keselamatan mereka.', '#7c2d12', '#1c1917', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/nQvMdF0bUEEM0jDzpWMUcaAkGsH.jpg', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w1280/mY2iDDJxNJkZ3HWJps7N5MzBjWz.jpg', 4, 'yo7X5ouM-Kg', '2026-08-13', 3.524, 2, 'tt43484979', 6.5, 18, 'TV-MA', null),
(1716222, 'Paket Santet', 'Kengerian', 98, 'NR', 'Sebuah paket tiba di depan pintu. Tidak ada nama pengirim. Tidak ada alasan mengapa paket itu ditujukan kepada mereka. Namun, sejak paket itu dibuka, hidup penerimanya langsung berubah jadi mimpi buruk. Satu per satu nyawa menjadi taruhan. Kini, pertanyaannya bukan lagi bagaimana cara menghindari paket tersebut, melainkan bagaimana cara terhindar dari kutukan setelah menerimanya.', '#7c2d12', '#1c1917', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ooeIRaAM9N02d8Z4eXPKE5BlBMM.jpg', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w1280/wP70ACOajhix1Ko845sBxUT9vkG.jpg', 6, 'iAAtCbIbGfU', '2026-08-27', 3.457, 2, 'tt42697813', 7.7, 7, null, null),
(1420041, 'Memburu Pemangsa', 'Aksi', 115, 'NR', 'Sekelompok jurnalis sedang menginvestigasi kasus pembunuhan anak, namun tiap petunjuk justru membuka teror baru, dan mencari tahu terlalu dalam membuat mereka dalam bahaya yang tak mereka pahami.', '#14532d', '#0f172a', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/iF8QBPgMvrqv1HEIPH2eIh6Z4eQ.jpg', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w1280/44fTEcaEtk7PmGFPZUSQEsThGGF.jpg', 5.7, 'PceQZIf1k70', '2026-09-24', 3.766, 3, 'tt35486488', null, null, null, null),
(1747310, 'Ghosthing', 'Komedi', 100, 'NR', 'A stoic mortician endowed with the ability to perceive the deceased finds his quiet existence upended when the dramatic spirit of a high-profile influencer refuses to depart, forcing him into an unauthorized investigation to prove her sudden demise was the result of homicide.', '#3b0764', '#0c0a09', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/rJYpSH06tKXoSArz6vDBIyaPf9Q.jpg', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w1280/cnwrrEcuDTwV5H21H35fZbHRUPE.jpg', null, 'WoL7tTL-hJQ', '2026-10-15', 3.503, 0, 'tt45972746', null, null, null, null),
(1541802, 'Operasi Pesta Copet', 'Komedi', 113, 'NR', 'In a desperate act to get quick money, Ijal and friends embark on a high-stakes operation: pickpocketing at Indonesia''s biggest music festival, Pestapora.', '#7c2d12', '#1c1917', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/q6jhaPlAnzNFuvPDbDXBDbavIXE.jpg', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w1280/zj0UjmCotGH7BnMRbKEr5ZxQUZE.jpg', 8, 'OB6e0VrfUyQ', '2026-08-27', 3.696, 2, 'tt38201949', 7.9, 71, 'TV-14', null),
(1716269, 'Rumah Singgah', 'Drama', 113, 'NR', 'Karla, a talented young runner diagnosed with bone cancer, receives treatment at a halfway house. There, she learns to accept reality through the support of the residents and bu Andin, while together they realize their ultimate dream.', '#134e4a', '#1c1917', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/m3N5NcK4rE7GOaWAuefr0xbncpX.jpg', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w1280/4WkrOK5DkGO0QIdggzejKoBeDOr.jpg', 7.6, 'B-LKbBHGWa4', '2026-08-27', 3.668, 4, 'tt39060117', null, null, null, null),
(1378262, 'Lobang Buaya, 309 Hari Sebelum Tragedi Berdarah', 'Kejahatan', 99, 'NR', 'When a spate of gruesome killings rocks the countryside in East Jakarta, army officer Soegeng is tasked with clearing up rumours about the military’s involvement. Soegeng’s investigation, however, confronts him with the foundations of corruption – a truth too close for comfort.', '#3b0764', '#0c0a09', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/eWgVIP4Z3BkgdOSbkO6Sr46ffyt.jpg', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w1280/mOLtKIvXd1SmobFAaANA1MOuoDk.jpg', 6, 'bxLqGxvjiYQ', '2026-10-01', 3.688, 1, 'tt34548453', null, null, null, null),
(1567791, 'Munafik: Melawan Iblis', 'Kengerian', 103, 'NR', 'Di perjalanan pulang setelah membantu sebuah keluarga mengusir Iblis di tubuh anak mereka, Adam (Arya Saloka) seorang pengajar agama sekaligus praktisi ruqyah mengalami kecelakaan maut yang membuatnya kehilangan Aini, istrinya. Sejak saat itu ia berhenti melakukan ruqyah dan hidup dalam kesedihan berkepanjangan. Sampai suatu hari, ia diminta Anwar (Dimas Aditya) menyelamatkan Fitri (Acha Septriasa) seorang perawat sekaligus putri dari Mansur (Donny Damara), figur yang dihormati di desa tempat Adam tinggal. Adam yang awalnya menolak menemukan alasan untuk kembali melakukan ruqyah karena mengingat pesan mendiang istrinya. Namun, seiring waktu ia menemukan ada rahasia gelap di balik terror gaib yang menimpa Fitri.', '#14532d', '#0f172a', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/sXrzWnoA14DWSMUqCEY0o0CTxPg.jpg', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w1280/9W2ZK1AzTE8WIw10gnzDzVLzXEc.jpg', 6.8, 'gkij9R9EV5o', '2026-09-03', 3.487, 2, 'tt38782610', 6.8, 13, 'TV-MA', null),
(1739312, 'Warga Rusun 609', 'Komedi', 103, 'NR', 'The idiosyncratic tenants of a public housing complex must form a unified front to resist an aggressive municipal demolition plan, all while covertly managing a severe supernatural haunting inside Room 609 by an aggrieved spirit demanding an unfulfilled romantic vow.', '#3b0764', '#0c0a09', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/d9k5T523oJjvNBEduSIuBJ6rvpR.jpg', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w1280/7uQrqaL25mCJXCCSYDBPRHfxGEu.jpg', 5, 'HK3qtX_S0FQ', '2026-10-01', 3.408, 2, 'tt43720940', 6.8, 16, null, null),
(1280076, 'Empat Musim Pertiwi', 'Drama', 137, 'NR', 'Pertiwi returns to her hometown after spending two decades in prison to rebuild her life. There, she finds power in things that have been abandoned: discarded electronic devices that mysteriously light up and a community of outcasts living on the fringes of society. But coming home also means confronting the four men who sent her to prison and now rule the village. Together with the outcasts, Pertiwi begins to uncover the darkness that still haunts the place - and the past she thought she had left behind.', '#7c2d12', '#1c1917', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/gjDK2E0FNwCxy3B915ODQZfy4QD.jpg', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w1280/7GtW8tgNMc8iL6nvzkY2vAwNvQs.jpg', 8.3, 'SV4PIdI9JL0', '2026-09-22', 2.779, 3, 'tt36459577', null, null, null, null),
(1578152, 'Ketok Mejik', 'Komedi', 114, 'NR', 'Ben, a grandson who is ''forced'' to inherit his grandfather''s "Ketok Magic" workshop. However, this inheritance comes with a series of problems that will confuse the entire village!', '#3b0764', '#0c0a09', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/csjeLHdrHyroPEhQstggsVFbAAs.jpg', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w1280/17ejCs8z3ZsTdTKJSv9Ouzvw6Do.jpg', 4.7, 'H_fjLEAThyE', '2026-08-13', 2.815, 3, 'tt38907288', 7.7, 7, null, null),
(1601704, 'Hasut', 'Kengerian', 96, 'NR', 'In the wake of their parents'' tragic decease, a young woman orchestrates a remote wilderness expedition to rehabilitate her estranged sister, only for the group to be terrorized by manipulative supernatural entities exploiting their communication devices.', '#831843', '#1e1b4b', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/wNv9rYd0Nqeq5vWPwyicognSER3.jpg', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w1280/sRpgypBSBlEqT3PEUIFoouuSUwX.jpg', 6, '6FDtvY6r9uo', '2026-10-08', 2.761, 2, 'tt44686440', 7.8, 9, null, null),
(1589665, 'Kuasa Gelap: Perjanjian Darah', 'Kengerian', 117, 'NR', 'Following a catastrophic, failed ritual in a remote Indonesian province, two Catholic exorcists are deployed to confront a devastatingly powerful ancient entity unleashed by an ancestral pact for illicit wealth.', '#1e3a8a', '#0f172a', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/pnr5cn7TJlGw6yUMgbCtDkGRLuQ.jpg', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w1280/yPeEsPDAsTrYpBNEwaO4xziacuI.jpg', 6.7, 'DKaO7xm7tpo', '2026-10-08', 2.722, 3, 'tt41272731', null, null, 'TV-MA', null),
(1757007, 'Kuru'' Sumange''', 'Drama', 100, 'NR', 'In a small town in the Bugis region, seven children from diverse backgrounds are brought together for a Regional Children''s Festival. Aisyah, a lonely girl, meets fellow participants who are each grappling with their own personal struggles. The judges group them together to stage a top-notch performance, and a variety of conflicts arise, challenging them to keep the show going in the name of friendship.', '#14532d', '#0f172a', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/4TP3GC9HpBJKE6ST1W3ZM5M2m3.jpg', null, null, null, '2026-08-30', 2.639, 0, null, null, null, null, null),
(1601709, 'Bapakmu Kiper', 'Komedi', 90, 'NR', 'The story follows an 18-year-old named Ronaldhino Sujatmiko—known as Dino—who harbors anger toward his father, Warto. Warto is a former local soccer star and soccer gambler whom Dino believes is responsible for his mother’s death. Dino’s chance to leave his village comes through the Tarkam Super Cup, a soccer talent search tournament. The conflict comes to a head when Dino’s main team is taken over by another party just before the final. This situation forces his father, Warto, to step in and form a new team made up of veteran players, despite all the limitations they face.', '#14532d', '#0f172a', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/e91DcxPpBfjAuVf67rP8zVFEjBi.jpg', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w1280/6dporxDetmS1eYrmIbpZfLdX81D.jpg', 5, 'zDv6_dfI7F8', '2026-09-03', 2.602, 1, 'tt43635381', 2.3, 791, null, null),
(1735459, 'Ibu, Bagaimana Aku Tanpamu?', 'Drama', 111, 'NR', 'Confronted with the devastating reality of her mother’s terminal diagnosis, a young woman embarks on a compressed emotional journey to fulfill her mother''s final, unexpressed desires before her imminent decease, forcing a profound reckoning with grief and filial duty.', '#1e3a8a', '#0f172a', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/zaL5fqcgMlBdkrwRF1g7XLDsbj0.jpg', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w1280/sLH3yzYvQn2UDWuEqtrsX1MAgB3.jpg', 6, 'Sh6ryxsOHYg', '2026-09-24', 2.588, 3, 'tt44773462', 6.1, 16, 'TV-G', null),
(1727650, 'Ibadah & Cinta', 'Drama', 116, 'NR', 'A secular young man raised in Australia undergoes a profound spiritual awakening after falling in love with the daughter of a prominent Islamic scholar, only for their matrimonial aspirations to be jeopardized by a pre-arranged betrothal mandated by her traditionalist family.', '#831843', '#1e1b4b', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/cQlIFMvnAAUH9MZ7l1UkSD13ddB.jpg', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w1280/v9pNRRWO5gZ1ybKxmKVeL7yTgSD.jpg', 7, '_k-qM7bnIbg', '2026-09-24', 3.028, 1, 'tt40201329', null, null, null, null),
(1699756, 'Ayah, Aku Mau Cerita....', 'Kejahatan', 166, 'NR', 'When his family stares down the barrel of criminal charges, a commoner channels his street smarts and knowledge of action films to tie the long arm of the law into an investigative Gordian knot.', '#831843', '#1e1b4b', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/1nHqIu8RAOv16yAWbVSL0XTsk3i.jpg', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w1280/oj93gx6nEqcmU8sFDr5c43bA0Jl.jpg', 6.5, '9nI65nJULvQ', '2026-08-20', 2.528, 2, 'tt42903440', null, null, null, null),
(1740545, 'Conjurig', 'Drama', 95, 'NR', 'Following a sudden job loss and the dissolution of his romantic relationship in the capital, a dejected young man retreats to his hometown of Bandung, masking his psychological vulnerabilities by donning a traditional ghost costume within a local street-performing subculture.', '#134e4a', '#1c1917', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/hWhVOc0ErQiyHH5q4AskPjaYeXT.jpg', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w1280/5m1bJ4pn69DgHQv9oUzoOFpht5L.jpg', null, 'j3CsY68ThoY', '2026-10-01', 2.181, 0, null, null, null, null, null),
(1469930, 'Tumbal Proyek', 'Kengerian', 106, 'NR', 'While investigating their father’s death inside a major bridge construction company, Yuda and his family attempt to prove that the frequent, deadly workplace accidents are actually human sacrifices.', '#3b0764', '#0c0a09', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/wdOa8jWX8u1YNSlWyRvoNCc9y7S.jpg', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w1280/k3Nc57fdRkzleHjodta45mGJV2C.jpg', 3.9, 'StEBQjJcubs', '2026-05-13', 22.013, 7, 'tt38497679', 6.8, 78, null, null),
(1421155, 'Ikatan Darah', 'Aksi', 119, 'NR', 'A former martial arts athlete must face a network of loan sharks to save her younger brother, who is trapped in online gambling debt and risking their family’s safety.', '#1e3a8a', '#0f172a', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/lF9amilOGIudUIq6NgDnz2YrPPa.jpg', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w1280/j5L5e211nYRd8DiLNDXbeGUsx7D.jpg', 6.5, 'Qq2Plb_X0gc', '2026-04-30', 9.958, 12, 'tt38221401', 8.3, 25, null, null),
(1590613, 'Cerita Lila', 'Kengerian', 106, 'NR', 'Lila, arwah seorang gadis kecil yang masih terikat pada masa lalunya, terus mencari saudari kembarnya yang hilang, Lili. Kehidupannya berubah saat Nia dan ibunya, Tari, pindah ke rumah tempat Lila berada. Persahabatan yang terjalin antara Lila dan Nia membawa mereka pada pencarian yang perlahan membuka rahasia kelam yang lama terkubur. Ketika kehadiran sosok Rahma mulai mengancam keselamatan mereka, Nia meminta bantuan Sara Wijayanto dan Wisnu untuk mengungkap kebenaran di balik tragedi masa lalu.', '#1e3a8a', '#0f172a', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/80CcJdrV3ewqPawFMAFGIrldgR5.jpg', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w1280/9rZVlvA5Nk3SA4GJk1ySUbZLtTg.jpg', 5, '_S9ummr0mjg', '2026-06-18', 5.159, 3, 'tt39400218', null, null, null, null),
(1575207, 'Dilan ITB 1997', 'Drama', 110, 'NR', 'Dilan is an ITB student who returned from Cuba in March 1997. In the midst of the heated political situation leading up to the Reformation.', '#14532d', '#0f172a', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/petyKATP9csA38xHWyyJqW1x7Vz.jpg', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w1280/r9XPwN4o9uZOEmw46fg6d9OIJQ5.jpg', 6.6, 'xzues7Sn_44', '2026-04-30', 3.501, 5, 'tt38873792', 7.9, 42, 'TV-14', null),
(1590909, 'Ibuku', 'Drama', 95, 'NR', 'A destitute widow and former traditional dancer defies social ostracization to embark on a desperate international journey, seeking a final reconciliation with her estranged daughter who faces execution abroad for the murder of an abusive employer.', '#14532d', '#0f172a', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/zYwxtzF9wIAPybLfU4s7sADX3ZG.jpg', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w1280/4HnXizTOzGJYc1FaHslow31dzZu.jpg', null, 'ItgV0HrDh9Q', '2026-10-08', 4.365, 0, 'tt38773544', null, null, null, null),
(1616674, 'Aku Sebelum Aku', 'Drama', 127, 'NR', 'A young student battling pressure, panic and a demanding father uses a class project to discover that truth — not trophies — might finally set him free.', '#831843', '#1e1b4b', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/xmwPr0YOFS6vC3aydnE85gxp36t.jpg', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w1280/1QiFfqaAhZi4HMlJNMvJVXOovc6.jpg', 6.7, null, '2026-07-11', 3.738, 22, 'tt39370887', null, null, null, null),
(1589713, 'Badut Gendong', 'Aksi', 101, 'NR', 'Darso, a clown busker, lost his wife and unborn child to thug violence. In grief, he brought his wife''s body back to his village. However, the village is in chaos due to a conflict with an evil developer and a curse ritual that summons dark forces. Darso is also caught up in the evil forces connected to the person he loves most.', '#1e3a8a', '#0f172a', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/kIAltyOVZFIRFFFgBUBABb0HyF7.jpg', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w1280/aVnrli2pknnbAeGhsjhLBWc5yCL.jpg', 8, 'yPaqYzR_ocI', '2026-05-27', 3.22, 4, 'tt39059815', null, null, null, null),
(1322532, 'Cek Khodam', 'Komedi', 110, 'NR', 'Nowadays, people are more afraid of empty wallets, late payments, and the end of the month than ghosts. Ghosts are even used as entertainment through the content Cek Khodam (Hodgkin''s Check) created by three friends, Sakti, Wira, and Bima. Unbeknownst to them, their actions have drastically reduced the Human Fear Score (AKM). To restore the dignity of the supernatural world and raise the human fear score, the Commander of the Khodam is tasked with descending directly into the human world. However, the mission does not go according to plan. The harder the khodam try to scare humans, the more chaos they create.', '#7c2d12', '#1c1917', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/o2aUDzJxXJOGxfCyKF6oawHBf2d.jpg', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w1280/f4P6rDf6FuXe1wtw2ZYJgVtu4G0.jpg', 5, 'D8xsvnUCqp4', '2026-07-16', 4.066, 4, 'tt33702073', null, null, null, null),
(1247038, 'Para Perasuk', 'Drama', 119, 'NR', 'In a town where pleasure equals being possessed by spiritual beings, Bayu aspires to be the shaman of a trance party so he can fundraise enough money to prevent an impending eviction.', '#831843', '#1e1b4b', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ipyK7A2rXwcnHXGVWGK9iJDDT8h.jpg', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w1280/4DUFiYoX7DBTFGrDSyW7lc8Wgm9.jpg', 7.6, 'TSlkrCZ_hYs', '2026-04-23', 4.048, 9, 'tt31382021', null, null, null, null),
(1263904, 'Monster Pabrik Rambut', 'Kengerian', 96, 'NR', 'PUTRI (Rachel Amanda) kehilangan ibunya, yang mati setelah beberapa hari tak tidur karena bekerja siang dan malam. Menurut MARYATI (Didik Nini Thowok), pemilik pabrik, ibunya mati bunuh diri. Awalnya ia percaya, tapi IDA (Lutesha), adiknya, mengatakan bahwa ibu mereka mati karena kesurupan. Untuk membuktikan omongannya, Ida memutuskan untuk lembur, tak tidur berhari-hari, demi melihat sendiri sosok hitam yang merebut tubuh ibunya. BONA (Iqbaal Ramadhan), adik bungsu mereka, memiliki kemampuan spesial. Ia mampu meregenerasi bagian tubuhnya. Sosok hitam berhasil menyandera Bona. Mampukah Putri dan Ida menyelamatkan Bona?', '#831843', '#1e1b4b', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/fiapXpPfhW3Uqjj0jMIVtaAdGRc.jpg', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w1280/m7pUxa1AaXjuvpFJsb4hvB25Lv.jpg', 7.2, 'onMcP76Nam8', '2026-06-04', 3.301, 3, 'tt34663597', null, 20, null, null),
(1423191, 'Resident Evil', 'Kengerian', 95, 'NR', 'Medical courier Bryan unwittingly finds himself fighting for survival as one fateful, horrifying night collapses around him in chaos.', '#14532d', '#0f172a', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/i7UyjfPio0VFHB9rBUZSFyhOoM8.jpg', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w1280/3icyRAqgakNcQn6aDVz9libFmBA.jpg', 7.3, 'mNd1gb19A-c', '2026-09-16', 296.641, 950, 'tt35538033', null, null, 'R', 3385),
(1377237, 'Runner', 'Aksi', 97, 'NR', 'A former soldier is thrown into a brutal race against time when a critical medical delivery makes him and his unlikely partner the targets of a ruthless cartel. As the mission spirals into a deadly manhunt, every detour, delay, and bullet pushes them closer to failure. With betrayal closing in from every side, they must survive the chase and deliver their cargo to save the life of a little girl.', '#14532d', '#0f172a', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/yBKMAIj7clP42UkFejhGDBBoTpb.jpg', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w1280/npXZNWjOEYrqdMDPQ11SGBrXqAG.jpg', 8.3, 'B6Z9MM1LhEA', '2026-09-07', 237.446, 575, 'tt31349844', 6.6, 493, 'PG-13', 4269),
(1101412, 'Fall 2: Deadpoint', 'Cerita Seru', 98, 'NR', 'On a perilous climb across Thailand''s Mount Kwan, two climbers become trapped thousands of feet above the ground, where vertigo-inducing heights, sheer exposure, and impossible odds turn every moment into a fight for survival.', '#831843', '#1e1b4b', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/fgSm5ylwiXbIHn8UbUXDjk9RRu4.jpg', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w1280/nGau0KBOaRILSK5MqFcuTfv7GMl.jpg', 7.3, 'Krs0VDIjhmE', '2026-09-01', 239.762, 543, 'tt31192372', 5.7, 1565, 'PG-13', 5061),
(1058424, 'Hope', 'Cerita Fiksi', 156, 'NR', 'Sebuah penemuan misterius terjadi di pinggiran kota pelabuhan kecil. Para penduduk mendapati diri mereka dalam kondisi perjuangan putus asa untuk bertahan hidup melawan sesuatu yang belum pernah mereka temui sebelumnya.', '#7c2d12', '#1c1917', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ptqlN6mDIAqJjVA86J5eOoG82zc.jpg', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w1280/ujUwzNV8ZkOzZonvhhHsc9KOKDf.jpg', 7.1, 'OFaJzL83y0Q', '2026-07-15', 191.174, 184, 'tt27369017', 6.9, 4367, 'R', 2451),
(1400837, 'Other Mommy', 'Kengerian', 93, 'NR', 'Young Bela forms a relationship with a sinister entity in her home that looks uncannily like her own mother, drawing her into a terrifying and increasingly dark world.', '#134e4a', '#1c1917', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/fGRNCssTRrhYZxNzykGGCoMsAVq.jpg', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w1280/ncm7djsVTHQQMX2HEbEVxMUFchG.jpg', 5.9, '-mnTITqqiT0', '2026-10-07', 139.339, 117, 'tt36586020', null, null, 'R', 1617),
(1302904, 'Practical Magic 2', 'Percintaan', 130, 'NR', 'The Owens sisters must confront the dark curse that threatens to unravel their family once and for all.', '#831843', '#1e1b4b', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ogwQOLbCfncjvBhFb5l0OmQH8KC.jpg', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w1280/oIglj0Jy9duG4LnrRUpH8n001Pk.jpg', 6.5, 'Ho10_4IX1jE', '2026-09-09', 139.895, 170, 'tt32588798', null, null, 'PG-13', 2785),
(1248832, 'Digger', 'Komedi', 129, 'NR', 'The most powerful man in the world embarks on a frantic mission to prove he is humanity''s savior before the disaster he''s unleashed destroys everything.', '#831843', '#1e1b4b', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/1ATXKrIPJyKNwnJ6lcG088Sa6zi.jpg', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w1280/b7t3r39Oll5qPxBKzLZ8eHMBD7l.jpg', 7.5, 'job8V254NAE', '2026-09-28', 114.922, 371, 'tt31450459', null, null, null, 1085),
(1153576, 'Street Fighter', 'Aksi', 120, 'NR', 'In 1993, estranged Street Fighters Ryu and Ken Masters are thrown back into combat when the mysterious Chun-Li recruits them for the next World Warrior Tournament: a brutal clash of fists, fate, and fury. But behind this battle royale lies a deadly conspiracy that forces them to face off against each other and the demons of their past. And if they don''t, it''s GAME OVER!', '#831843', '#1e1b4b', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/dJPT2Uf12X6aFg8i5N67NTpIZ9t.jpg', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w1280/zDE9hd1SG9695YncbZGjSf7Z9Jk.jpg', 6.4, 'U6sbm1OaJb8', '2026-10-13', 117.229, 28, 'tt27419420', 6.2, 1231, 'PG-13', null),
(1263337, 'Heart of the Beast', 'Petualangan', 101, 'NR', 'After a harrowing plane crash, Special Forces officer James Belmont and his combat dog, Odin, find themselves stranded deep in the Alaskan wilderness. Together, they are forced into a brutal fight for survival against the elements.', '#1e3a8a', '#0f172a', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/1ApfSA8JTqeha3GTFEY8syV4auq.jpg', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w1280/bicMU6xVD5deVyKP2azpyx7xkmH.jpg', 7.4, 'UkMuGKqAux4', '2026-09-19', 84.416, 298, 'tt7526136', 7.5, 542, 'PG-13', 1213),
(299534, 'Avengers: Endgame', 'Petualangan', 181, 'NR', 'Terdampar di luar angkasa tanpa persediaan makanan dan minuman, Tony Stark berusaha mengirim pesan untuk Pepper Potts dimana persediaan oksigen mulai menipis. Sementara itu para Avengers yang tersisa harus menemukan cara untuk mengembalikan 50% mahluk di seluruh dunia yang telah dilenyapkan oleh Thanos.', '#3b0764', '#0c0a09', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/bR8ISy1O9XQxqiy0fQFw2BX72RQ.jpg', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w1280/7RyHsO4yDXtBv1zUU3mTpHeQ0d5.jpg', 8.2, 'L2NAh3CIdig', '2019-04-24', 85.687, 29011, 'tt4154796', 8.4, 1497908, 'PG-13', 1241),
(1283515, 'Verity', 'Misteri', 114, 'NR', 'Lowen Ashleigh, hired to ghostwrite for best-selling author Verity Crawford, uncovers Verity''s autobiographical notes, and becomes involved in what may prove to be a lethal conspiracy.', '#1e3a8a', '#0f172a', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/zPHfsaiMZT1HNz1ZS55iyLKZkFG.jpg', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w1280/3BoHXmGAfC2qO4wnCpMYV0BzpHD.jpg', 6.4, 'xdPMKhjMSFs', '2026-09-30', 78.057, 204, 'tt32261958', null, null, 'R', 1601),
(1281331, 'The Social Reckoning', 'Drama', 113, 'NR', 'Frances Haugen, a young Facebook engineer, enlists the help of Jeff Horwitz, a Wall Street Journal reporter, to go on a dangerous journey that ends up blowing the whistle on the social network''s most guarded secrets.', '#1e3a8a', '#0f172a', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/7jK6NuxVg1XuEV7UdNa6KO03IgZ.jpg', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w1280/wXTaGcqX3jvdXSKCJAkl5jZyrKp.jpg', 7, 'R8ANzYpaZaY', '2026-10-07', 59.227, 105, 'tt37510326', null, null, null, 932),
(1465063, 'Forgotten Island', 'Animasi', 109, 'NR', 'While celebrating their last night together, high school graduates and best friends Jo and Raissa stumble upon a mysterious portal that transports them to the fantastical island of Nakali. When they discover that the memories of their entire friendship are the price for returning home, Jo and Raissa must race to find a way to leave the island before they forget each other forever.', '#1e3a8a', '#0f172a', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/myd1K3gefdNAWFsGNRDdMeiK9Qg.jpg', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w1280/cNICUho5uiAGkfCAQq1ihyaMla4.jpg', 8, 'PhgY8cOJiQA', '2026-09-10', 54.421, 72, 'tt36583977', 7.7, 1331, 'PG', null),
(1400940, 'Clayface', 'Kengerian', 108, 'NR', 'Matt Hagen''s meteoric rise from Gotham street kid to Hollywood leading man is tragically cut short when a local crime boss''s actions leave him horribly disfigured. Abandoned by his team and with nothing left, Matt seeks out a cutting edge treatment that miraculously returns him to his former self… but also unexpectedly affects his grip on reality, spiraling him down a destructive path of all-consuming revenge.', '#7c2d12', '#1c1917', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/5jCpQnWPikggmQZoDp1eAi6BI6w.jpg', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w1280/kVtOcoUJ68chBD2tmERkdWz7lK5.jpg', 8.6, 'f7jlCqdtwdM', '2026-10-21', 41.636, 6, 'tt34890576', null, null, null, null),
(1447853, 'Oasis: Don''t Look Back in Anger', 'Dokumenter', 123, 'NR', 'Experience the meteoric rise of Oasis through rare footage and untold stories as the band reunites for Oasis Live ''25, chronicling their journey from Manchester streets to global rock stardom.', '#134e4a', '#1c1917', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/5XoHhKZ1IROW6f5UlRpADHnTL2l.jpg', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w1280/7Ud7QIJo21odjCaev6V4md9sK16.jpg', 7.4, 'X9sIYLtgc_s', '2026-09-09', 32.069, 32, 'tt36150957', 8.6, 801, 'R', 621),
(1594914, 'Lucky Strike', 'Aksi', 102, 'NR', 'A wounded American soldier fights to survive behind enemy lines during WWII''s Battle of the Bulge against the Germans, relying on his instinct, spy craft and a hand-radio to evade capture and find his way back to his unit.', '#7c2d12', '#1c1917', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/kzRAd7mj39ZY3FGNrDdZjqx56tn.jpg', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w1280/uujYvxE9s6KY4SbBZ0ZFN3oBJhW.jpg', 6.6, 'vtEnjikCXyA', '2026-06-26', 34.184, 57, 'tt19035928', null, null, null, null),
(1400499, '近畿地方のある場所について', 'Kengerian', 103, 'NR', 'After an editor of an occult magazine suddenly vanishes, his friend Chihiro and his co-worker Yusei set out to discover the reason behind his disappearance.', '#14532d', '#0f172a', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/fhKkr22UpULWNemcgCjppTkHXgf.jpg', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w1280/e0vwcf5R1yU2Uz2mTO4KbCxL5tT.jpg', 6.3, null, '2025-08-08', 30.12, 27, 'tt34969899', 6.3, 836, null, null),
(1234139, 'ஜெயிலர் 2', 'Aksi', 163, 'NR', 'When a dangerous syndicate expands its reach to threaten his family''s peace, retired jailer Tiger Muthuvel Pandian goes undercover as a driver. Operating from the shadows, he takes on ruthless new enemies to protect his home.', '#134e4a', '#1c1917', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/upwdEyhhYZ7pT2hD535fr2MGfpx.jpg', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w1280/zpHTOdRl7GEPqFsDGqsN6Hi9Ylt.jpg', 7, null, '2026-10-14', 26.952, 2, 'tt33318732', null, null, null, null),
(1755291, 'NAZA', 'Dokumenter', 77, 'NR', 'Filmed at night from Tel Aviv rooftops, this investigative documentary examines the civilian casualties of Israel''s military operations in Gaza and the systems behind targeted killings of Palestinians.', '#14532d', '#0f172a', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/bYfN1EKVyj2O7KXwuWDDCc47B5T.jpg', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w1280/7EzH0dlEN9OZWWBXBWwT5PbMNUz.jpg', 8.2, '40KW6knYMo4', '2026-09-25', 17.389, 82, 'tt44766123', 7.9, 3173, null, null),
(1545621, '名探偵コナン ハイウェイの堕天使', 'Aksi', 109, 'NR', 'When a string of deadly highway incidents begin, Conan Edogawa''s investigations point towards an orchestrated plot rather than mere accidents. As he uncovers a conspiracy involving hidden identities and advanced technology, the case escalates into a high-speed race against time to stop a calculating mastermind before more lives are lost.', '#14532d', '#0f172a', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/l2kfiNoRi6ofM5pSjr1rCloOfpx.jpg', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w1280/zT5S4GNs8Eu2gIkGORoN6yC1uE2.jpg', 7.4, '-OmZGxr23hY', '2026-04-10', 15.656, 22, 'tt39123115', 6.2, 594, null, null),
(1269325, 'दृश्यम: आखिरी हिस्सा', 'Cerita Seru', 148, 'NR', 'Years after outsmarting the police, Vijay Salgaonkar''s past resurfaces when a new evidence threatens to expose his secret. As the investigation reopens, he must outwit the system once again to save his family.', '#1e3a8a', '#0f172a', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/7T62GSduOWDMB0gGDBs9pmtLTSB.jpg', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w1280/nq73eRdEooripf3k0XHLtX14zyC.jpg', 7.7, 'MFQFxsDWbA8', '2026-10-02', 18.365, 9, 'tt27050858', null, null, null, null),
(1103857, 'Juliet & Romeo', 'Drama', 122, 'NR', 'Set at the dawn of the fourteenth century, a revisionist adaptation of history''s most celebrated star-crossed lovers rejects classical iambic pentameter in favor of a contemporary pop music score, charting their efforts to alter the course of their tragic destiny and expose a political truth crucial to the future of the Empire.', '#1e3a8a', '#0f172a', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/4spOdjLgRAbIYO7mu22DQ2iInz7.jpg', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w1280/5vkYsIN0BpDlATvHCjufG5SimkU.jpg', 6, 'HLOfwe_0YsA', '2025-05-09', 5.998, 14, 'tt26597666', 3.9, 696, 'PG-13', null),
(730251, 'HAPPYEND', 'Drama', 113, 'NR', 'In a near-future Japanese city bracing for a devastating earthquake, a group of teenage friends navigate personal struggles and fractured bonds amid rising tension.', '#14532d', '#0f172a', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/uaSmMj7kBP6elOp4CnpTsrF2AyL.jpg', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w1280/shWIpYYqbgpUUefpPj1VrYbPonE.jpg', 6.8, '8gWKm5eFo44', '2024-10-04', 6.259, 46, 'tt29279903', 6.8, 2304, null, null),
(961214, '부활남: 더 레드', 'Aksi', 102, 'NR', 'Despite unwavering support from his best friend Young-ha and the unwavering support of his younger sister Ye-rin, job seeker Seok Hwan just can''t seem to land a job, repeatedly failing interviews. One night, after yet another disastrous interview, he returns home only to be attacked by a group of strangers and killed. But 72 hours after his death, Seok Hwan suddenly opens his eyes as if nothing happened. He soon discovers that he possesses a special ability: no matter how many times he dies, he comes back to life. But there''s little time to process his extraordinary new power before a mysterious figure known as Black, who has discovered Hwan''s existence, begins hunting him down. Yet with each resurrection, Seok Hwan grows stronger, unleashing powers beyond anything he could have imagined!', '#3b0764', '#0c0a09', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/nLsyRK3SmtdIftozpCd8sGQMRGD.jpg', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w1280/kiDd05NykJBIoEvJPSG5SOd7qc6.jpg', 5, null, '2026-09-30', 7.129, 1, 'tt29452783', null, null, null, null),
(1706702, 'Daniel and the Fiery Furnace', 'Drama', 108, 'NR', 'During the Jewish exile to Babylon, Daniel and his friends face trials as Babylon''s armies conquer Jerusalem. Under King Nebuchadnezzar, they gain royal favor but make enemies. Their faith is tested at the fiery furnace.', '#3b0764', '#0c0a09', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/leE7dixdbzHXUBJdQgW1fFHz0ru.jpg', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w1280/4EoROOIIvrOLarSmM3EcCVxtaDl.jpg', 6.8, 'FYm_sWSw6Eo', '2026-09-18', 6.823, 5, 'tt37542993', null, null, null, null),
(1394740, '타짜: 벨제붑의 노래', 'Kejahatan', 130, 'NR', 'Jang Taeyoung, who believes he has everything after building a successful online casino business, loses it all to his former best friend and namesake, Park Taeyoung. The two reunite on the international poker circuit for a high-stakes battle of revenge.', '#831843', '#1e1b4b', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ueigb5zra1tj6FTK9yhh2P33P9B.jpg', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w1280/w5OX3u2SpMVRU0sol0mtIaf4LSI.jpg', 7, 'gDgTGFltqBw', '2026-09-23', 6.578, 3, 'tt39233100', null, null, null, null),
(1552493, 'Khadam', 'Drama', 118, 'NR', 'Melor, who is forced to inherit her family''s inheritance. As a result, she must race against time to save her daughter from a dark entity that is beginning to take over her life.', '#134e4a', '#1c1917', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/elwBj5UKnGNSzLIQLNbGgsW5g3J.jpg', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w1280/3wZmVqOrmHOB8j83LmpAbyNwWnE.jpg', 6.7, 'T8OpDWG9rUs', '2026-06-11', 6.194, 6, 'tt38267329', null, null, null, null),
(1388805, 'LINKIN PARK: UNSHATTER', 'Musik', 108, 'NR', 'After a seven-year hiatus following the devastating loss of their beloved bandmate Chester Bennington, LINKIN PARK''S remaining members struggled to find their way forward. Their shared history and enduring friendship, combined with the fresh perspective of two new band members Emily Armstrong and Colin Brittain spark a renewed creative energy that leads them on a transformative journey of artistic reinvention. Following the band from intimate 2022 studio sessions through their explosive FROM ZERO album release and concert in São Paulo, this documentary weaves together rare vault footage, electrifying performances from sold-out shows, and candid interviews with band members and fans—capturing the raw, honest story of what it means to start over.', '#14532d', '#0f172a', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/kHNrz7DBVPrtyMhJxmBm2poS2l9.jpg', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w1280/uL1HCc4wmcFcSr1zS3kXX3CNUeE.jpg', 9.3, 'K9Lpxc7bVTM', '2026-09-30', 4.323, 12, 'tt43442522', 8.6, 875, null, null),
(1319525, 'จีบซ้ำซ้ำ เฮนรี่จำไม่ได้', 'Komedi', 115, 'NR', 'Lucy, a woman who''s living her first date on repeat with Henry, a good-natured, animal-loving guy with a bizarre condition: every time he wakes up, he can''t remember anything from the day before.', '#134e4a', '#1c1917', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/qlw9WtySGW6AUdbkwgWUltvIAf3.jpg', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w1280/luQZKJZmp92kiwUZeXOpp0SrinL.jpg', 6, 'q1xP2WQyn-E', '2026-09-17', 4.49, 2, 'tt37846333', null, null, null, null),
(1257942, '魔方小姐', 'Komedi', 107, 'NR', 'At the age of seventy, a fiercely non-conformist grandmother partners with a lethargic, underachieving young prodigy to navigate the highly competitive and eccentric subculture of speedcubing, defying familial skepticism and generational expectations.', '#7c2d12', '#1c1917', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/qvTiG4LSu6wFCfXjg2KTiqHeQBF.jpg', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w1280/bLxfaYqA9YlVuXbU9eK1E2u3MLI.jpg', 6.2, 'V9ctZj2mEC0', '2026-06-19', 3.28, 5, 'tt36130077', null, null, null, null),
(1215889, 'दायरा', 'Kejahatan', 141, 'NR', 'Raman, who has had a shady record with staged encounters and police brutality, finds himself cornered as Ajooni challenges him on every step.', '#1e3a8a', '#0f172a', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/qQ6ORv3AfsV6m1ERL8Muk5jKpbu.jpg', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w1280/rbwmf04kpX1o3zbbOS6Y7woF2Ku.jpg', null, null, '2026-09-18', 3.282, 0, 'tt32634611', null, null, null, null),
(1148365, 'Matchbox the Movie', 'Aksi', 127, 'NR', 'Ketika sekelompok mantan teman masa kecil bertemu kembali, reuni mereka menjadi kacau saat tak sengaja menemukan konspirasi internasional yang berbahaya dan kini mereka harus menyelamatkan dunia.', '#1e3a8a', '#0f172a', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/lFKA4GMz36dImEy3DQPdPF7G4V9.jpg', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w1280/y6RIuwuxLG3Nsb37KUj5yatnTIp.jpg', 7.9, '7xfqITrMDcI', '2026-10-05', 391.643, 329, 'tt28498219', null, null, 'PG-13', 9238),
(1368337, 'The Odyssey', 'Petualangan', 173, 'NR', 'Odysseus, raja legendaris Yunani dari Ithaca, memulai perjalanan panjang dan berbahaya untuk pulang setelah Perang Troya, yang mengisahkan perjumpaannya dengan makhluk-makhluk mitologis seperti Cyclops Polyphemus, para Siren, dan penyihir-dewi Circe.', '#1e3a8a', '#0f172a', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/5rhTDKUhPYvpdQIijFIs5VoWsON.jpg', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w1280/nVBzWBqHTB3XD0iqWiJLfKLo5fq.jpg', 8, 'AyIZ9tiiN8I', '2026-07-15', 379.509, 4137, 'tt33764258', 8.4, 477953, 'R', 1593),
(1236045, 'Animals', 'Cerita Seru', 109, 'NR', 'Saat putra mereka diculik, seorang kandidat wali kota LA dan istrinya kalang kabut mengumpulkan tebusan sambil membuat keputusan yang bisa menghancurkan hidup mereka.', '#14532d', '#0f172a', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/iISM36voS1E8gX9BM0DVK0kgi3E.jpg', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w1280/tzoarEu7TsG959upiELyYPm5kO9.jpg', 7.2, 'ZkN2M4ODdys', '2026-10-09', 262.606, 378, 'tt31049299', null, null, 'R', 9787),
(1228834, 'The Fix', 'Aksi', 142, 'NR', 'Disillusioned by the end of the war in Afghanistan, a group of disgraced, war-torn ex-CIA operatives set out to Tehran to take down a life-changing score.', '#831843', '#1e1b4b', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/jlP8XDjZN89GrpM3je5Uf8Grqx8.jpg', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w1280/dJTWIecL2vxsCRl5G0lRhPsfrhc.jpg', 6.8, 'l5Luvr9TRRc', '2026-09-10', 231.377, 64, 'tt9601292', null, null, null, 1146),
(1339713, 'Obsession', 'Kengerian', 109, 'NR', 'Setelah menghancurkan "One Wish Willow" yang misterius untuk memenangkan hati gebetannya, seorang romantis yang putus asa menemukan dirinya mendapatkan apa yang dia minta tetapi segera menemukan bahwa beberapa keinginan datang dengan harga yang gelap dan menyeramkan.', '#14532d', '#0f172a', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/bRwnj8WEKBCvmfeUNOukJPwB43K.jpg', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w1280/5lTZyuBTNOfawsfPT8Q0cIg6qAF.jpg', 8.2, 'gMC8kkwbIQQ', '2026-05-13', 175.506, 6130, 'tt37287335', 7.8, 392842, 'R', 2307),
(1751701, 'After Impact', 'Cerita Fiksi', 95, 'NR', 'After losing his father, Ethan Nichols inherits one of the largest greenhouses in the country, just as the world faces a devastating threat from an approaching asteroid. As society begins to unravel, Ethan grapples with personal betrayal, overwhelming loneliness, and the growing fear that survival may come at the cost of his humanity. Seeking refuge in his family’s bunker, Ethan endures the harsh aftermath of the impact, wrestling with physical injury and emotional despair. When a faint voice crackles over his radio, Ethan discovers he''s not as alone as he believed.', '#1e3a8a', '#0f172a', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/yzDuAQCY2n6zzOlBkn6JzhLhY3k.jpg', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w1280/k22XyPbce7zvzzf5OnT4uaY8ZD1.jpg', 5.8, 'Af8D6sRDyxo', '2026-09-15', 130.944, 27, 'tt36809539', null, null, null, null),
(1204680, 'Coyote vs. Acme', 'Komedi', 103, 'NR', 'After Acme products fail him one too many times in his dogged pursuit of the Roadrunner, Wile E. Coyote decides to hire a billboard lawyer to sue the Acme Corporation.', '#7c2d12', '#1c1917', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/kYDCl2y0VPvhT5eYWbMRInPoB03.jpg', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w1280/viZqGq9TNvQ5uXSD4ahg2RpRONT.jpg', 7.5, 'kMsiD1Nky5I', '2026-08-20', 136.502, 748, 'tt1756855', 7.6, 18537, 'PG', 4077),
